Approach for buildFactoryState (huge function): extract helpers. Each extracted helper must itself have CRAP ≤ 8 (CC ≤ 2 untested, or covered). Existing helpers in the file (like normalizeMutexSnapshot, zombiesSweptTotal) show the established pattern — small pure helpers with CC ≤ 2 or tested.

